#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:3108
msgid "A CAPTCHA mode is required."
msgstr "Рэжым CAPTCHA - абавязковы, патрабаваны."

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities-diagnostics.php:1192
msgid "A cid or an IP address is required."
